 But we do feel that making a first move and a first step toward that, that the council adopted a public art code last year,

1151
01:26:18,360 --> 01:26:28,360
 that this would be a good time to make a tiny step forward on that as part of overall efforts to elevate that look and feel as part of rebranding.

1152
01:26:28,360 --> 01:26:29,360
 Can I ask a question?

