 Like, because I guess the question is, where does it stop?

1163
01:27:11,360 --> 01:27:12,360
 We could rebrand everything.

1164
01:27:12,360 --> 01:27:23,360
 We could paint this room orange if we wanted to, but at what point is what you guys approved when you approved it, what was contemplated and planned?

1165
01:27:23,360 --> 01:27:27,360
 Because there's more and more things that keep getting added to it.

1166
01:27:27,360 --> 01:27:33,360
 And I think we need to be mindful of that because, yeah, it would be nice to improve the way of life for our residents.

1167
01:27:33,360 --> 01:27:35,360
 But you know what's really nice?

1168
01:27:35,360 --> 01:27:38,360
 Them having enough money to be able to buy groceries and put gas in their car.

1169
01:27:38,360 --> 01:27:48,360
 So I just thinking like we need to have a better idea of where we're headed with this instead of bringing back stuff.

1170
01:27:48,360 --> 01:27:55,360
 Because you mentioned even when you talked about the public art item, you said that's a hundred thousand dollars for this year only.

